---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Button from "../components/ui/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="e-Invoicing Italy - FatturaPA & PEPPOL" description="Invoice Ninja e-invoicing compliance for Italy. Support for FatturaPA, PEPPOL, and all major EU e-invoice standards." path="/e-invoicing-italy/">
  <Header slot="header" />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <nav class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <a href="/e-invoicing/" class="hover:text-primary">e-Invoicing</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">Italy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-dark mb-4">e-Invoicing in Italy</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-4">Con sede nell'UE? E tempo di imparare la fatturazione elettronica!</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8">Mandatory electronic invoicing in the EU is coming soon! With our PEPPOL integration, you can start sending and receiving electronic invoices immediately.</p>
      <Button href="https://app.invoicing.co/#/register" size="lg">Create a Free Account!</Button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is e-Invoicing? -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-6">What is e-Invoicing?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Electronic invoicing adoption is expanding rapidly across jurisdictions worldwide. Instead of sending PDF invoices by email, e-invoicing uses structured data formats that can be automatically processed by accounting systems on both ends of a transaction.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Invoice Ninja supports the UBL (Universal Business Language) format and various electronic invoice standards, including FatturaPA for Italy. Our platform enables direct invoice delivery through the PEPPOL network, ensuring your invoices reach their recipients in a compliant, machine-readable format.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">All <strong>Enterprise Plan</strong> subscribers automatically receive <strong>250 e-invoicing credits at no additional cost</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FatturaPA Focus -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-6">FatturaPA for Italy</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">FatturaPA is Italy's mandatory electronic invoicing format. Italy was one of the first EU countries to mandate e-invoicing for all B2B and B2C transactions, and FatturaPA is the required format for all invoices issued in Italy.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">FatturaPA invoices are routed through the government's SDI (Sistema di Interscambio) system. The SDI acts as a central hub that receives, validates, and forwards electronic invoices between parties. This requires prior registration with the SDI system before you can begin sending electronic invoices.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Invoice Ninja generates fully compliant FatturaPA invoices and handles the routing through the appropriate channels, simplifying the process for your business.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PEPPOL Network -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-6">The PEPPOL Network</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Invoice Ninja has deployed a PEPPOL access point, enabling you to send and receive e-invoices across a vast international network.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">PEPPOL is like working with a telecommunications provider. When you make a phone call, you just dial the number and your provider works with the recipient's provider to establish the connection. You don't need to worry about the technical details -- it just works.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">PEPPOL functions as an extremely secure international network that allows your company to exchange critical business documents electronically with any registered participant -- currently hundreds of thousands of public and private companies across borders.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- All Supported Standards -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-8">All Supported e-Invoice Standards</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">PEPPOL</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Universal, cross-industry and cross-border standard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">ZUGFeRD / XRechnung</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Germany's electronic invoicing standard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">Facturae</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Spain's mandatory electronic invoice format.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">FatturaPA</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Italy's electronic invoicing format via SDI.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">FACT1</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Romania's electronic invoicing standard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">EN16931</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Generic EU electronic invoicing standard.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Getting Started -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-6">Getting Started with e-Invoicing in Italy</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Each jurisdiction requires specific mandatory fields for electronic invoice validation. For Italy, ensure your Invoice Ninja account has the following properly configured:</p>
      <ul class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li>Codice Fiscale (Italian tax code)</li>
        <li>Partita IVA (VAT number)</li>
        <li>Complete company address details</li>
        <li>Correct tax rates and categories for your line items</li>
        <li>Codice Destinatario (SDI recipient code) for your clients</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 mb-6">
        <p class="text-amber-800"><strong>Important:</strong> Italy requires government registration with the SDI (Sistema di Interscambio) system before you can send electronic invoices. FatturaPA invoices are routed through this government system, so prior registration is mandatory.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8">Our support team can help validate your account data and guide you through SDI registration to ensure successful FatturaPA invoice generation and delivery.</p>
      <div class="text-center">
        <Button href="https://app.invoicing.co/#/register" size="lg">Create a Free Account!</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
